API “one switch”."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"FAPI 2.0 is not a single feature but a bundle of constraints — mandatory PAR, mandatory PKCE","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"S256"},{"type":"text","text":", mandatory strong client authentication, mandatory sender-constrained tokens,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and a refusal of every relaxation the base specs permit. Encoding them as one profile rather","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"than a dozen independent booleans means an operator cannot register a client that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"nearly","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" FAPI, and a reviewer can answer “is this client financial-grade?” by reading one"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"field. The same philosophy as the rate-limit postures: ordinary clients see no behaviour","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"change at all, because ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"Self::Standard"},{"text":" is the serde default and every row","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"written before schema v38 decodes to it.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"ClientProfile","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClientProfile"}]}}}